1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:11,114
Disability and complex healthcare cases can scatter one person's story across providers, portals, tests, forms, and personal records.

2
00:00:11,114 --> 00:00:15,280
The challenge is not merely storing documents.

3
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:25,399
It is preserving what the evidence says, what remains uncertain, and what a human has actually accepted.

4
00:00:25,799 --> 00:00:31,596
Neverlost begins with a simple rule: preserve before you understand.

5
00:00:31,596 --> 00:00:36,814
Case Navigator keeps each canonical source visible before interpretation.

6
00:00:36,814 --> 00:00:44,350
Open AI can surface candidate information, but every result remains a proposal.

7
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:50,728
A human decides whether it becomes part of the accepted case.

8
00:00:50,728 --> 00:00:52,467
AI proposes.

9
00:00:52,467 --> 00:00:53,626
Human decides.

10
00:00:54,026 --> 00:00:58,516
This demonstration follows Maya, a fully synthetic client.

11
00:00:58,516 --> 00:01:04,689
We open her cardiology and orthostatic evaluation, source S zero two.

12
00:01:04,689 --> 00:01:14,230
For repeatable judging, this recording replays the outputs from our validated live Open AI smoke test.

13
00:01:14,230 --> 00:01:24,332
The server reconstructs the canonical fixture, and local validation requires exact preserved evidence before any candidate enters review.

14
00:01:24,732 --> 00:01:29,771
Candidates arrive marked as AI generated and unreviewed.

15
00:01:29,771 --> 00:01:33,130
One reflects findings consistent with POTS.

16
00:01:33,130 --> 00:01:35,930
Another preserves missing autonomic testing.

17
00:01:35,930 --> 00:01:39,289
Neither changes Maya's case on arrival.

18
00:01:39,289 --> 00:01:45,448
The consultant checks evidence, then can accept, edit, reject, or hold.

19
00:01:45,448 --> 00:01:52,726
Here, supported evidence is accepted, an unsupported claim rejected, and unresolved evidence held.

20
00:01:52,726 --> 00:01:57,765
Only reviewed content enters accepted state and the timeline.

21
00:01:58,165 --> 00:02:06,086
From reviewed state, Case Navigator generates a disability-focused packet through its deterministic output path.

22
00:02:06,086 --> 00:02:11,745
It is not drafted directly from arbitrary AI text.

23
00:02:11,745 --> 00:02:19,666
Supported information appears with source context; rejected or held material does not silently reappear.

24
00:02:19,666 --> 00:02:28,154
Provenance traces an accepted statement through its source, proposal, human decision, timeline, and packet appearances.

25
00:02:28,554 --> 00:02:31,493
Everything shown uses synthetic data.

26
00:02:31,493 --> 00:02:43,837
It is not medical or legal advice, is not approved for production healthcare data, and makes no HIPAA or benefits determination.

27
00:02:43,837 --> 00:02:47,951
Production security and compliance require separate architecture.

28
00:02:47,951 --> 00:02:57,356
Neverlost helps people and systems work with complex information without losing context, provenance, or human responsibility.
